# Deterministic State & Agent Task Idempotency

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` autonomous agent runtime workspace.

## 1. Dynamic State Tokens
All asynchronous or multi-step agent flows must use dynamic, cryptographically secure state identifiers (UUIDs) to prevent replay or cross-session state corruption.

## 2. Idempotent Processing
Agent task handlers must verify whether a task ID has already been executed before running inference or tool actions.
